# ==============================================================================
# DEVOP2 - EXERCISES - the ONLY .gitignore of the repository
# (the former Unit01/02/03 .gitignore files were merged here on 2026-11-15)
# ==============================================================================

# --- 1. Secrets: never commit credentials -------------------------------------
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
certs/
*.crt
*.key
*.pem
*.p12

# --- 2. Old files that still contain clear-text passwords ---------------------
.backup_*/
Unit02.zip
yml1__
docker-compose.yml__

# --- 3. Local tools, generated data, lab repositories -------------------------
Unit01/mongosh-*/
mongo_data/
es_data/
kibana_data/
Unit02/data/
**/venv/
__pycache__/
*.log
*.zip
_to_delete/
# repositories created while doing the labs (they have their own remote)
Unit04/release-strategies-lab/
Unit05/TestProj/
Unit05/rollback-lab/

# --- 4. Editor / OS noise ------------------------------------------------------
*.wbk
~$*
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini
.vscode/
.idea/

# --- 5. Course material: only my own work goes to GitHub, not the course -------
# Every PDF / PowerPoint / Word file is ignored (lab handouts, theory, slides).
# Exceptions: the documents I wrote myself.
*.pdf
*.pptx
*.docx
!Unit01/Unit 01 - API Basics.docx
!Unit02/Elasticsearch.docx
!**/P0*_DELIVERABLE.pdf
!**/P0*_DELIVERABLE.docx

